title Home Assistant: the real 480x320 panel (the Pi 3A+'s 3.5" Luckfox, 79x49 mm, 6.1 px/mm): "Server" and the address whole, on the Connect page and in Settings
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env HA_DEMO connect
env HA_DEMO_PHONE ok

wait 900
shot connect-panel
check connect-panel
expect text "Server"
expect text "homeassistant.local"
wait 3500
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 500
shot settings-panel
check settings-panel
expect text "Server"
expect text "homeassistant.local:8123"
expect noquit
